 "check": {
  "describe": "Dark: a deep navy screen; 'Two sources, one pond' at the top; in the middle a round pond in perspective inside a grey stone rim, its surface rippling in rings from two small gold balls, deep navy in the troughs, cyan to white on the crests, with calm radial nodal lines between; at the bottom a rounded pad with a gold puck and readouts '1.0 Hz', '2.0 m', '1.1 m'. Later in time the ripples have moved and the view has swayed. Dragging the puck to the top right gives 1.8 Hz and 3.6 m: shorter waves, sources wider apart, many more nodal lines. Landscape: pond on the right, text and pad on the left. Small (2x2): the pond alone. Light: the same pond on a pale grey-blue page, brighter lagoon water, dark ink text, a white pad with an amber puck. Mono: the same layout in black and white, crests as solid onSurface bands (a ripple tank), still.",
